### Phase 6: everything goes through the API Gateway on :8080.
### Token:  ./infrastructure/keycloak/pkce-login.sh alice 2>/dev/null   (ada for ADMIN)

@gw = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@adminToken = paste-ada-access-token-here

### Routed to user-service
GET {{gw}}/api/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Routed to account-service. Location in the response is relative (/api/accounts/{id}).
POST {{gw}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerId": "7f3c9a2e-1b4d-4e8a-9c6f-2d5b8e1a0f3c", "type": "SAVINGS", "currency": "THB" }

### Your own correlation ID is kept if it is safe ([A-Za-z0-9-]{8,64})
GET {{gw}}/api/accounts?ownerId=7f3c9a2e-1b4d-4e8a-9c6f-2d5b8e1a0f3c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Request-Id: my-debug-session-001

### No token: rejected at the edge, never reaches a service
GET {{gw}}/api/accounts

### CORS preflight as the browser sends it for Angular (expect 200 + Access-Control-Allow-*)
OPTIONS {{gw}}/api/accounts
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization,content-type

### CORS preflight from an unknown site (expect 403)
OPTIONS {{gw}}/api/accounts
Origin: https://evil.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST

### Live routing table (ADMIN only)
GET {{gw}}/actuator/gateway/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Not under /api: denied by the allow-list
GET {{gw}}/internal/anything
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
